# Ancient Flames Beckon, Spire of Dem, a repeat clear (checkSkipCutscene). main (Below the Arks current, a GM) leads bob,
# who has passed The Mothercrystals (An Invitation West current) and holds the light of Dem: he is no registrant: the
# non-registrant requirement (1-3 completed, or the light) holds. main registers (area 1), bob enters the existing
# fight. The Progenerator killed: WON; main's win: newPromy 1, repeatClear 0 (no light yet), 32001; bob's: no newPromy
# (the light held, not 1-2 or 1-3 current), repeatClear 1 (autoSkip: the light), arg8 over the other two lights: 1, 32001.
# Both finished: main's mission handler (1-2 complete); bob's none.
lists SpireOfDem/_0j0/onTrigger SpireOfDem/onEventUpdate/32000 SpireOfDem/onEventFinish/32000 SpireOfDem/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=SpireOfDem pos=0,-3.8,240 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=SpireOfDem pos=0,-3.8,240 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop BelowTheArks current
bob: mission Cop AnInvitationWest current
bob: keyitem LightOfDem
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
trigger _0j0                            # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
bob: trigger _0j0                       # the clearance: the menu (enterExisting)
bob: update 32000 option=1              # area 1: entered
bob: finish                             # in the arena
tick 2000                               # the Progenerator spawns
kill PROGENERATOR                       # allDeath: WON; the wins: 32001 to both
finish                                  # main: the light of Dem, 1-2 complete
bob: finish                             # bob: repeatClear 1, no handler
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # out of the battlefield
